WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,870 --> 00:00:02,950
You stinky boy

2
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,590
You ate the heart of a bear and the gall of a leopard, right?

3
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,670
A loan is such a big thing

4
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:06,990
You dare not discuss it with us

5
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,670
Do whatever you want

6
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:10,070
Do you have us in your heart?

7
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:15,340
Is there such a housewife?

8
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,420
I have a business to take out a loan, what business should I do?

9
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:20,150
Is it right to buy a tin boat?

10
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,790
Our current boat is too small

11
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,830
It takes more than two hours to play the drum back and forth every day.

12
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,950
My hands have worn out several layers of skin.

13
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,470
I thought since I bought it

14
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,590
It's better to buy one

15
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:29,630
Once and for all

16
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:31,030
At least fifteen meters long

17
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,070
You still have to take it off the internet

18
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:33,870
By the way, we can build a series of ditches or something.

19
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:36,710
You shouldn’t be able to buy a second-hand boat like this, right?

20
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:37,790
I want to buy a brand new one

21
00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:38,750
Customize yourself

22
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:40,880
At least more than 10,000 yuan

23
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,560
Zhang Jianguo

24
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,880
Selling such a big step all at once

25
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,520
Aren't you afraid of hurting yourself?

26
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:48,440
Go into the house and say

27
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,360
these days

28
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,400
Relying on going to sea

29
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,280
I now have a deposit of 6,000 yuan in my hand

30
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:54,080
The owner of the house received a loan of 8,500 yuan

31
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,080
The total is fourteen thousand and five thousand. Tie Zishu is over there.

32
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:58,400
There is also a gray star sand in our house at the technical school.

33
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,280
I can sell it in two days, so I guess.

34
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:02,840
In fact, the money to buy new fish balls is almost the same.

35
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:04,200
There's still nearly two thousand dollars left.

36
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,760
Don't worry, I have a way to deal with the blind people on the isolated island.

37
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:08,040
I should be able to fish for two more days.

38
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:09,000
No matter how small the quantity is

39
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,400
It's not a big problem to scrape together two thousand yuan.

40
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,720
Mom, please look forward to the good times and wait until you have a big ship.

41
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,360
Song Yuan and I can go to farther seas

42
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:15,800
There is little competition and plenty of surplus goods.

43
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,960
Wait until I make a lot of money

44
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:18,320
This old house was demolished for our family.

45
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:19,280
build a big house

46
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,760
How nice it is to make your stay comfortable

47
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,760
As long as the family is together neatly

48
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,840
Can't live in a big house

49
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,880
Mom doesn’t care at all

50
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:29,160
Mom knows that you are very competitive now, but getting a loan is not a trivial matter.

51
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,920
Mom, I already got the money anyway.

52
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:31,880
Just believe me once

53
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:33,880
Just let me give it a try, okay?

54
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:34,800
My son has grown up

55
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,840
There are strong winds and waves ahead

56
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,880
Let him take the big opportunity
